<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link><description>World News Today: Read the latest world news headlines, Current International breaking news world wide. In depth analysis and top news headlines world wide.</description><language>en-gb</language><lastBuildDate>2025-08-26T06:37:18+05:30</lastBuildDate><atom:link type="application/rss+xml" rel="self" href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/rssfeeds/296589292.cms"/><copyright>Copyright:(C) Tue, 26 Aug 2025 06:37:18 IST Bennett Coleman &amp; Co. Ltd, http://in.indiatimes.com/policyterms/1554651.cms</copyright><docs>http://syndication.indiatimes.com/</docs><image><title>World News, Today World News, Latest International News, World Breaking News, Trending News of World - Times of India</title><url>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/507610.cms</url><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world</link></image><item><title>Trade row: Trump says he could ‘destroy China’; hints at 200% tariffs on rare earths</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123513438.cms" /&gt;President Trump asserted the U.S. holds significant leverage over China, hinting at the potential to severely damage their economy if necessary, during a meeting with South Korean President Lee Jae Myung. He mentioned ongoing trade disputes and recent conversations with President Xi Jinping, considering a trip to Beijing.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/international-business/us-china-trade-row-donald-trump-says-he-could-destroy-china-hints-at-200-tariffs-on-rare-earths/articleshow/123513438.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/international-business/us-china-trade-row-donald-trump-says-he-could-destroy-china-hints-at-200-tariffs-on-rare-earths/articleshow/123513438.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-26T06:09:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Business Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123513457,imgsize-842599.cms"/></item><item><title>UK helicopter crash: 3 die as chopper spirals into field during a flight lesson; cause under probe</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123513459.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/uk-helicopter-crash-3-die-as-chopper-spirals-into-field-during-a-flight-lesson-cause-under-probe/articleshow/123513459.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/uk/uk-helicopter-crash-3-die-as-chopper-spirals-into-field-during-a-flight-lesson-cause-under-probe/articleshow/123513459.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-26T06:17:32+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123513543,imgsize-1022276.cms"/></item><item><title>National guard in Chicago? Not on our watch: Illinois governor slams Trump plan | Watch</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123512127.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/national-guard-in-chicago-not-on-our-watch-illinois-governor-jb-pritzker-slam-trump-plan-court-battles-loom-watch/articleshow/123512127.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/national-guard-in-chicago-not-on-our-watch-illinois-governor-jb-pritzker-slam-trump-plan-court-battles-loom-watch/articleshow/123512127.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-26T02:48:44+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123512131,imgsize-105026.cms"/></item><item><title>To boost UAE–India ties, Sheraa and Startup Middle East sign MoU to launch India Startup Hub in Sharjah</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123511768.cms" /&gt;Sheraa and Startup Middle East have signed an MoU to launch the India Startup Hub in Sharjah, aiming to connect Indian entrepreneurs with the UAE’s innovation ecosystem. The partnership enables cross-border collaboration, market access, and startup support through key programs and events. It also strengthens Sheraa’s global reach and supports sectoral expertise from India, including Kerala’s diaspora network.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/to-boost-uaeindia-ties-sheraa-and-startup-middle-east-sign-mou-to-launch-india-startup-hub-in-sharjah/articleshow/123511768.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/to-boost-uaeindia-ties-sheraa-and-startup-middle-east-sign-mou-to-launch-india-startup-hub-in-sharjah/articleshow/123511768.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-26T02:40:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123512124,imgsize-560706.cms"/></item><item><title>Watch: Helicopter spirals out of control, spins wildly before crashing into lake</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123512116.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/helicopter-spirals-out-of-control-spins-wildly-before-crashing-into-lake-while-fighting-wildfire-watch-terrifying-footage/articleshow/123512116.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/europe/helicopter-spirals-out-of-control-spins-wildly-before-crashing-into-lake-while-fighting-wildfire-watch-terrifying-footage/articleshow/123512116.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-26T02:53:20+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123512135,imgsize-4640554.cms"/></item><item><title>Comedian Reggie Carroll shot dead: Meet suspect Tranell Williams</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123512085.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/comedian-reggie-carroll-shot-dead-meet-suspect-tranell-williams/articleshow/123512085.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/comedian-reggie-carroll-shot-dead-meet-suspect-tranell-williams/articleshow/123512085.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-26T02:18:08+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123512091,imgsize-514332.cms"/></item><item><title>What is cashless bail? Trump signs executive orders to end ‘dangerous’ policy</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123511986.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/you-never-see-the-person-again-trump-signs-executive-order-to-block-cashless-bail-why-some-call-it-fair-others-dangerous/articleshow/123511986.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/you-never-see-the-person-again-trump-signs-executive-order-to-block-cashless-bail-why-some-call-it-fair-others-dangerous/articleshow/123511986.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-26T02:04:37+05:30</pubDate><dc:creato