e/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123511523,imgsize-136244.cms"/></item><item><title>‘Forced to look into the camera’: US teacher jailed for 215 yrs after videotaping abuse of students</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123510636.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/forced-to-look-into-the-camera-us-teacher-jailed-for-215-years-after-videotaping-abuse-of-students-school-district-sued/articleshow/123510636.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/forced-to-look-into-the-camera-us-teacher-jailed-for-215-years-after-videotaping-abuse-of-students-school-district-sued/articleshow/123510636.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-26T00:12:30+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123510874,imgsize-31570.cms"/></item><item><title>Flesh-eating parasite resurfaces in US: Maryland confirms first human screwworm case</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123508953.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/flesh-eating-parasite-resurfaces-in-us-maryland-confirms-first-human-screwworm-case-what-makes-it-so-dangerous/articleshow/123508953.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/flesh-eating-parasite-resurfaces-in-us-maryland-confirms-first-human-screwworm-case-what-makes-it-so-dangerous/articleshow/123508953.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-25T23:23:04+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123509702,imgsize-10148.cms"/></item><item><title>Elon Musk vs big tech: xAI sues Apple, OpenAI; billionaire accuses rivals of monopoly deal</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123507219.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/international-business/elon-musk-vs-big-tech-xai-sues-apple-openai-billionaire-accuses-rivals-of-monopoly-deal/articleshow/123507219.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/international-business/elon-musk-vs-big-tech-xai-sues-apple-openai-billionaire-accuses-rivals-of-monopoly-deal/articleshow/123507219.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-25T21:28:41+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Business Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123507225,imgsize-39966.cms"/></item><item><title>'At some point': Donald Trump signals readiness for meeting Kim Jong Un; hints at renewed talks</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123507457.cms" /&gt;Donald Trump expressed openness to meeting North Korean leader Kim Jong Un "at some point," ahead of South Korean President Lee Jae Myung's visit to the White House. Trump highlighted their past turbulent relationship, marked by initial threats and subsequent historic meetings, including a summit in Singapore and a DMZ encounter. Despite collapsed talks in Hanoi, Trump suggested a future meeting remains a possibility.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/at-some-point-donald-trump-signals-readiness-for-meeting-kim-jong-un-hints-at-renewed-talks/articleshow/123507457.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/at-some-point-donald-trump-signals-readiness-for-meeting-kim-jong-un-hints-at-renewed-talks/articleshow/123507457.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-25T22:14:37+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123507847,imgsize-1022655.cms"/></item><item><title>'There will be more transactions': More Intel-like deals coming soon? What Donald Trump's aide said</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123507643.cms" /&gt;The U.S. government's $8.9 billion stake in Intel, facilitated by the CHIPS Act, signals a novel investment approach, according to Kevin Hassett. While the government aims for financial returns without interfering in company operations, Intel cautions about potential risks, including reduced grant opportunities and adverse impacts on its global business.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/international-business/there-will-be-more-transactions-more-intel-like-deals-coming-soon-what-donald-trumps-aide-said/articleshow/123507643.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/business/international-business/there-will-be-more-transactions-more-intel-like-deals-coming-soon-what-donald-trumps-aide-said/articleshow/123507643.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-25T22:09:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI Business Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123507701,imgsize-1112666.cms"/></item><item><title>'Watched her gasp for breath': Teen found dead; father’s chilling confession stuns police</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123506224.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/watched-her-gasp-for-breath-before-dying-us-teen-found-dead-wrapped-in-pride-flag-fathers-chilling-confession-stuns-police/articleshow/123506224.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/watched-her-gasp-for-breath-before-dying-us-teen-found-dead-wrapped-in-pride-flag-fathers-chilling-confession-stuns-police/articleshow/123506224.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-25T20:32:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123506438,imgsize-505812.cms"/></item><item><title>Deadly flesh-eating parasite detected in US for the first time: emergency measures in place, symptoms explained</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123506259.cms" /&gt;A rare case of the New World screwworm, a flesh-eating parasite, has been identified in Maryland in a person returning from El Salvador. The larvae burrow into wounds, causing severe tissue damage. Authorities are implementing emergency measures, including sterile fly production and enhanced surveillance, to prevent further spread and protect both humans and livestock.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/deadly-flesh-eating-parasite-detected-in-us-for-the-first-time-emergency-measures-in-place-symptoms-explained/articleshow/123506259.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/deadly-flesh-eating-parasite-detected-in-us-for-the-first-time-emergency-measures-in-place-symptoms-explained/articleshow/123506259.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-25T20:21:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123506264,imgsize-1106300.cms"/></item><item><title>DJ, Elon’s ‘snake’, MAGA henchman: Who is Sergio Gor – Trump's pick to be US Ambassador to India?</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123505963.cms" /&gt;But by 2020, with Paul’s influence waning and Trump ascendant, Gor made the switch. He joined Trump’s re-election machine, helped manage fundraising, and became a close ally of Donald Trump Jr. Together they founded Winning Team Publishing, turning Trump’s doodles and grudges into glossy bestsellers. The “snake” was learning to coil tighter around power.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/sergio-gor-donald-trump-elon-musk-snake-dj-us-ambassador-to-india/articleshow/123505963.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/sergio-gor-donald-trump-elon-musk-snake-dj-us-ambassador-to-india/articleshow/123505963.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-25T20:14:28+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Nirmalya Dutta</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123506167,imgsize-932599.cms"/></item><item><title>From El Salvador to Uganda: Kilmar Garcia’s fight takes new turn, Trump admin pushes deportation</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123505658.cms" /&gt;Kilmar Abrego Garcia, a Maryland construction worker once wrongly deported to El Salvador, surrendered to US authorities amidst claims of MS-13 affiliation. Facing human smuggling charges he denies, Abrego Garcia now faces potential deportation to Uganda under a controversial agreement. His case involves legal battles, family separation, and accusations from Homeland Security, leaving his future uncertain.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/from-el-salvador-to-uganda-kilmar-abrego-garcias-fight-takes-new-turn-trump-admin-pushes-deportation-kristi-noem-brands-him-ms-13-child-predator/articleshow/123505658.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/from-el-salvador-to-uganda-kilmar-abrego-garcias-fight-takes-new-turn-trump-admin-pushes-deportation-kristi-noem-brands-him-ms-13-child-predator/articleshow/123505658.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-25T19:55:26+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123505877,imgsize-100584.cms"/></item><item><title>UAE President sends special recorded message to students and parents on first day of school</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123504687.cms" /&gt;As over one million students returned to UAE schools today, President Sheikh Mohamed bin Zayed marked the start of the 2025–26 academic year with a recorded message urging students to pursue learning with passion, uphold national values, and use AI responsibly. The year also sees the launch of an AI curriculum and key assessment reforms.</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/uae-president-sends-special-recorded-message-to-students-and-parents-on-first-day-of-school/articleshow/123504687.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/middle-east/uae-president-sends-special-recorded-message-to-students-and-parents-on-first-day-of-school/articleshow/123504687.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-25T19:44:01+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123505783,imgsize-1325942.cms"/></item><item><title>‘DC is safe and booming’: Trump touts crackdown; slams ‘incompetent’ Chicago mayor</title><description>&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/123504715.cms" /&gt;</description><link>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/dc-is-safe-and-booming-trump-touts-crackdown-slams-incompetent-chicago-mayor-threatens-to-straighten-out-city-next/articleshow/123504715.cms</link><guid>https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/world/us/dc-is-safe-and-booming-trump-touts-crackdown-slams-incompetent-chicago-mayor-threatens-to-straighten-out-city-next/articleshow/123504715.cms</guid><pubDate>2025-08-25T19:06:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">TOI World Desk</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-123505092,imgsize-98406.cms"/></item></channel></rss>